# upstream tests/unit by hxmc's JavaScript generator (bin/jsgen/haxe), from a copy of
# the suite (UpstreamSuites.hx): what every target compiles with (compile-each.hxml),
# each test announced (the runner counts them). UpstreamSuites adds -D hxmc.js, the
# output (-js) and the skips (-D UTEST_PATTERN).
compile-each.hxml
--main unit.TestMain
-D UTEST_PRINT_TESTS
